[2026-03-14T21:30:56.917Z] {"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_015qryzSujPT5PpuZiGzYCdJ","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Excellent! Now I have all the information needed. Let me compile a comprehensive report:\n\n## Linear-Clone / Inbox App - Complete Report\n\nI've thoroughly explored the `/repo/apps/LinearClone` directory which contains the issue tracking application with Inbox/notification functionality. Here's the complete information you requested:\n\n### 1. App Directory Path and Structure\n\n**App Path**: `/repo/apps/LinearClone`\n\n**Top-level Directory Structure**:\n```\n/repo/apps/LinearClone/\n├── .env\n├── .gitignore\n├── AppSpec.md (10KB - main specification)\n├── eslint.config.js\n├── index.html\n├── netlify.toml\n├── package.json\n├── package-lock.json\n├── playwright.config.ts\n├── tsconfig.json\n├── tsconfig.app.json\n├── tsconfig.node.json\n├── vite.config.ts\n├── docs/\n│   └── tests.md (198KB - comprehensive test specifications)\n├── logs/ (test run logs)\n├── netlify/\n│   └── functions/ (27 API endpoint files)\n├── node_modules/\n├── public/\n├── scripts/\n│   ├── check.ts\n│   ├── deploy.ts\n│   ├── schema.ts\n│   ├── seed-db.ts (database seeding script)\n│   └── test.ts (test runner)\n├── src/\n│   ├── components/ (58 component files)\n│   ├── pages/ (23 page files)\n│   ├── slices/ (Redux slices)\n│   ├── App.tsx\n│   ├── index.css\n│   ├── main.tsx\n│   └── store.ts\n└── tests/\n    ├── keyboard-shortcuts.spec.ts\n    ├── login.spec.ts\n    ├── my-issues-filters.spec.ts\n    ├── my-issues-row.spec.ts\n    ├── my-issues.spec.ts\n    ├── sidebar-collapse.spec.ts\n    ├── sidebar-navigation.spec.ts\n    ├── sidebar.spec.ts\n    └── signup.spec.ts\n```\n\n### 2. Inbox-Related Test Entries from docs/tests.md\n\nThe test specification includes comprehensive test cases for the Inbox feature. Key Inbox-related test sections:\n\n**Sidebar Inbox Navigation Tests**:\n- Sidebar renders \"Inbox\" link with inbox icon\n- Sidebar Inbox link navigates correctly (user navigates to `/inbox` and link appears active)\n- Sidebar Inbox badge shows unread notification count (e.g., \"3\" for 3 unread)\n- Sidebar Inbox badge updates when notifications are read\n- Sidebar Inbox badge not shown when no unread notifications\n- Sidebar active highlight updates on navigation\n- Sidebar collapse state persists - icons remain clickable for Inbox\n\n**Keyboard Shortcuts**:\n- `G` then `N` navigates to Inbox (`/inbox`)\n\n**Inbox Page Tests** (`/inbox`):\n- Inbox page renders with list of notifications (reverse chronological order)\n- Empty state when no notifications\n- Unread notifications visually distinct (bold text, left border accent in primary color `#5e6ad2`)\n- Inbox header shows notification count (e.g., \"Inbox (5)\")\n- Notification list updates sidebar badge when notifications change\n- Notifications ordered by newest first\n- Archiving notifications removes them from list\n- All notifications can be archived to reach empty state\n\n**Notification Row Tests**:\n- Clicking unread notification marks it as read (visual style change, database persisted, sidebar badge decremented)\n- Clicking read notification doesn't change state\n- Clicking notification navigates to issue detail page\n- Notification row archive button visible\n- Archive button archives without navigating (stays on `/inbox` page)\n- Notification shows correct icon per type (assignment, issue update, mention)\n- Marking as read then archiving works sequentially\n- Click targets for \"mark as read + navigate\" and \"archive\" are clearly separated\n\n**Issue Creation Notification**:\n- Creating issue with assignee generates inbox notification for assignee\n\n### 3. Playwright Config File\n\n**Path**: `/repo/apps/LinearClone/playwright.config.ts`\n\n```typescript\nimport { defineConfig } from '@playwright/test';\nimport { replayDevices, replayReporter } from '@replayio/playwright';\n\nexport default defineConfig({\n  testDir: './tests',\n  timeout: 60000,\n  expect: {\n    timeout: 10000,\n  },\n  fullyParallel: true,\n  forbidOnly: true,\n  retries: 0,\n  reporter: [\n    replayReporter({ upload: false }),\n    ['json', { outputFile: 'test-results/results.json' }],\n    ['html', { open: 'never' }],\n  ],\n  use: {\n    ...replayDevices['Replay Chromium'],\n    baseURL: 'http://localhost:8888',\n    actionTimeout: 15000,\n  },\n});\n```\n\nKey Configuration:\n- Uses Replay.io for debugging test recordings\n- Base URL: `http://localhost:8888`\n- Test directory: `./tests`\n- Timeout: 60s (tests), 10s (assertions), 15s (actions)\n- Fully parallel execution\n- Multiple reporters: Replay, JSON, and HTML\n\n### 4. Seed Data File\n\n**Path**: `/repo/apps/LinearClone/scripts/seed-db.ts`\n\nThe seed script creates:\n- **Workspace**: \"Acme Corp\"\n- **Members**: \n  - Alice Johnson (alice@acme.com, admin)\n  - Bob Smith (bob@acme.com, member)\n  - Carol Davis (carol@acme.com, member)\n- **Teams**: Engineering (ENG), Design (DES)\n- **Labels**: Bug, Feature, Improvement, Documentation\n- **Projects**: V2 Launch\n- **Cycle**: Sprint 12 (active)\n- **Issues**: 8 for Engineering team, 3 for Design team\n- **Notifications for Alice**: 3 notifications (assignment, comment, mention) on ENG-2\n\nDatabase tables truncated and seeded: projects, workspaces, members, teams, team_members, labels, issues, issue_labels, cycles, sessions, comments, activity, notifications, project_milestones, project_activity\n\n### 5. Existing Test Files\n\n**Location**: `/repo/apps/LinearClone/tests/`\n\n9 Playwright test spec files:\n1. `keyboard-shortcuts.spec.ts` (7.4 KB)\n2. `login.spec.ts` (8.2 KB)\n3. `my-issues.spec.ts` (10.7 KB)\n4. `my-issues-filters.spec.ts` (17.6 KB)\n5. `my-issues-row.spec.ts` (19.2 KB)\n6. `sidebar.spec.ts` (14.9 KB)\n7. `sidebar-collapse.spec.ts` (8.0 KB)\n8. `sidebar-navigation.spec.ts` (4.2 KB)\n9. `signup.spec.ts` (8.5 KB)\n\n**Note**: There is NO existing `inbox.spec.ts` or `notifications.spec.ts` test file yet - these appear to be features awaiting test implementation.\n\n### 6. Netlify Functions Directory\n\n**Path**: `/repo/apps/LinearClone/netlify/functions/`\n\n**27 API Functions** including:\n- **Notification-related**: \n  - `notifications.ts` (2.9 KB) - GET all notifications, PUT to mark read/archive\n  - `notifications-count.ts` (1.7 KB) - GET unread count\n- **Issue-related**: create-issue.ts, issue-detail.ts, update-issue.ts, etc.\n- **User/Auth**: login.ts, me.ts, signup.ts\n- **Team**: teams.ts, team-issues.ts, team-members.ts\n- **Project**: projects.ts, project-detail.ts, update-project.ts, project-milestones.ts\n- **Cycles**: cycles.ts, cycle-issues.ts\n- **Other**: labels.ts, members.ts, workspace.ts, search-issues.ts, add-comment.ts, bulk-update-issues.ts, db.ts\n\n**Notification API Endpoints**:\n- `GET /api/notifications` - Fetch all non-archived notifications for current user\n- `PUT /api/notifications/<id>/read` - Mark notification as read\n- `PUT /api/notifications/<id>/archive` - Archive notification\n- `GET /api/notifications-count` - Get count of unread, non-archived notifications\n\n### 7. Inbox Components\n\n**Pages**:\n- `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/pages/Inbox.tsx` (1.2 KB)\n\n**Components**:\n- `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/components/NotificationList.tsx` (1.8 KB)\n- `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/components/NotificationRow.tsx` (4.7 KB)\n\nThe Inbox page uses Redux to fetch and display notifications, manages unread count in the header, and delegates rendering to NotificationList and NotificationRow components."},{"type":"text","text":"agentId: aa7f48f9253bac5bb (for resuming to continue this agent's work if needed)\n<usage>total_tokens: 38779\ntool_uses: 21\nduration_ms: 40309</usage>"}]}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"8c773c69-5b70-4948-a5ae-cf557e586ea9","uuid":"fc31dbe8-41ee-443b-b70e-7d1e583adfcc","tool_use_result":{"status":"completed","prompt":"Find the app related to \"linear-clone\" o